      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w15.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝から、太い雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "掲示板に「本日、全興行休止」倍率を洗い流す雨の日は、傘の下の足が、自然とあの店へ向かう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳の先が、雨で少し重い。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉店後のカジノカフェ。窓際の定席に、剣士さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「去年も、この席だったのう」そうでしたね、とだけ返して、向かいに座る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二年目の雨は、会話が短くて済む。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "店の中は、いつになく賑やか。常連たちが、赤線の一覧の写しを囲んでいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「次はどの条文か」を茶請けに、倍率のつかない賭け。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨の日の賭場の民は、賭けにならない賭けでも楽しめる。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "券売のおじさんが、しみじみ言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「赤線が増えるたびよ、窓口の空気が軽くなるんだ」台本の無い試合。休める救護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……壊した条文の跡に、良い空気が育っている。中間報告としては、上々だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w15.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯気の向こうで、ふと、自分でも不思議になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった者でもない私が、なぜ去年を覚えているのだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……考えは、雨の音に流した。今日は、その話の日じゃない。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手帳を開いて、次の一手の整理を始めた。三本目の標的は、胴元総取り・的中固定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あの予想紙を、どう破るか。倍率の無い日は、頭がよく回る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "剣士さんが茶のお代わりを頼んで、書き物を黙って見守った。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、掲示板の予想紙が雨に濡れていた。「的中率100%」の字が、滲んでいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w15.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……滲んだ予想は、当たるのだろうか。次の大会で、確かめる。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w15.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
